Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.45,0:00:32.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.88,0:00:35.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见到你真高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a sight for sore eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.20,0:00:41.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-还好吗  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Doing okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.75,0:00:43.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.88,0:00:47.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-遇上麻烦了吗  -没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Any trouble? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你遇上了  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You had some. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.43,0:00:53.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:01:00.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔  给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol, I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.47,0:02:32.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.80,0:02:32.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.25,0:02:44.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按1到10算  你有多饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}How hungry are you, scale of one to 10?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.73,0:02:45.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,15\N{\fnArial\fs30}15.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.57,0:02:48.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,28\N{\fnArial\fs30}28.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.30,0:02:53.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  有一阵子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.66,0:02:56.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去看看圈套\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go check the snares.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.43,0:02:58.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能和你一起去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I go with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.99,0:03:02.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然你怎么学技术呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how else are you gonna learn?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.02,0:03:08.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.83,0:03:22.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们再待一两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll stay another day or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.62,0:03:23.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,休息会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some more rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.58,0:03:26.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,痊愈了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finish healing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.06,0:03:29.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我快痊愈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.27,0:03:34.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们很近了  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're close now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.99,0:03:36.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离终点站吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Terminus?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.12,0:03:37.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是的  -很近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.16,0:03:42.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到那里后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we get there,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.61,0:03:44.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要告诉他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}are we gonna tell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.24,0:03:47.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他们什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.23,0:03:51.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们经历的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything that's happened to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.87,0:03:53.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做过的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the stuff we've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:03:57.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要告诉他们真相吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we gonna tell them the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.99,0:04:01.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要告诉他们我们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna tell them who we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.39,0:04:04.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你要怎么说呢  我是说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how do you say that? I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.72,0:04:07.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}who are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.91,0:04:31.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.19,0:04:35.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是只小的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a small one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.57,0:04:37.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也能凑合\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.57,0:04:44.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个简单的活结\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is just a simple slipknot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:46.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在绳子的两头打结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tie one on both ends,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.41,0:04:48.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后把一端系在树枝上\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you tighten one side to a branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.79,0:04:50.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能看到这地面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you see how the ground here
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.98,0:04:52.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点像漏斗形的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is sort of like a funnel shape?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.28,0:04:55.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这是条小路吗  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a trail? - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.61,0:04:57.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要把套索放在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where you want to set the noose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:04:58.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用叶子遮住\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you hide it with leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.91,0:05:00.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在旁边摆上木棍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you put sticks all around it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.81,0:05:03.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,经过的动物必须走这条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}so any animals going by have to run this way
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.03,0:05:06.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚好踩中圈套\N{\fnArial\fs30}right into the trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.26,0:05:08.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:10.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快救命  -卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Somebody help! - Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.72,0:05:13.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-卡尔  停下  卡尔  -后退  后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carl, stop! Carl! - Get back! Back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.61,0:05:15.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.43,0:05:17.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走开  后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.03,0:05:19.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命  来人救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Somebody help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.11,0:05:21.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.56,0:05:23.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.48,0:05:25.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.15,0:05:27.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.34,0:05:29.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-救命  来人救救我  -我们救不了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help! Somebody help! - We can't help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.15,0:05:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.27,0:05:43.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.67,0:06:13.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.39,0:06:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.61,0:06:19.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  只是想要人帮点忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, just want a little help with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.97,0:06:22.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.89,0:06:25.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经没有时间概念了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never know what time it is anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:27.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从我把表给了格伦以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since I gave Glenn my watch,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.68,0:06:29.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说都是当下时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's always right now to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:31.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是早上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's early.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.57,0:06:35.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's decent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.31,0:06:39.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-早  -早\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning. - Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.05,0:06:40.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝丝会照看朱迪思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bethy's gonna take Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:43.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要干嘛去\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.09,0:06:45.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待会儿你就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.91,0:06:48.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你用不上那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going to need that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.89,0:06:51.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪只会碍事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll just get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.25,0:07:05.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.68,0:07:13.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这条路上可能会有房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought maybe there'd be some houses down this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.86,0:07:16.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能有商店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe even a store.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.31,0:07:20.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这周围总会有点吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be some food around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.54,0:07:22.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.29,0:08:05.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这兔子太小了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was one small rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.23,0:08:07.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少有吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.17,0:08:10.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得感谢它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to hand it to the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.51,0:08:12.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,味道好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It traveled well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.30,0:08:18.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎现在我们只会谈这一个话题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you noticed that's all we talk about anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.26,0:08:20.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.11,0:08:24.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都忘了风餐露宿的感觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot what this feels like.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.83,0:08:25.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.75,0:08:29.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望我们能尽快再次忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope we're able to forget again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.67,0:08:32.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再坚持一天就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just got to make it through another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.20,0:08:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然那里的人在收人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If folks there are taking people in,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.10,0:08:40.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们一定很强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}they have to be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.32,0:08:42.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们一定有一套体系\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have to have a system.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.93,0:08:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不知道是真是假\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder if the whole thing's legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.81,0:09:02.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就收过人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We let people in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.13,0:09:03.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.80,0:09:06.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总督也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So did the Governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.16,0:09:11.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  总是如此  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's always the same, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.81,0:09:13.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后才会知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get to know until we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.33,0:09:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能这个地方都不存在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this place isn't even there anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.80,0:09:19.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呦喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dearie me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.25,0:09:23.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你死定了  混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You screwed up, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.95,0:09:27.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听见了吗  你死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me? You screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.32,0:09:41.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天是算账的日子  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today is a day of reckoning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.52,0:09:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了结恩怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Restitution.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.69,0:09:47.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个宇宙又会回到平衡的状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}A balancing of the whole damn universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.07,0:09:55.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好在新年前夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, and I was thinking of turning in for the night
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.15,0:09:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有着急睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}on New Year's Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.85,0:10:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁跟我一起来倒数新年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now who's gonna count down the ball dropper with me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.51,0:10:04.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 Mississippi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:06.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine Mississippi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.89,0:10:08.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-八  -乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eight Mississippi. - Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.20,0:10:23.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-等等  -我刚数到八  达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold up. - You're stopping me on eight, Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:28.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.69,0:10:31.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个人把卢杀死了  没什么好谈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the guy that killed Lou, so we got nothing to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.73,0:10:34.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们最不缺的就是时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing about nowadays is we got nothing but time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:37.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么要说的  达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say your piece, Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.61,0:10:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.93,0:10:43.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你放他们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna let 'em go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.39,0:10:45.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.32,0:10:50.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得卢不会同意这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I think Lou would disagree with you on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.41,0:10:51.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了  我得替他说话  因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll, of course, have to speak for him and all
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.94,0:10:54.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的朋友在厕所里把他勒死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause your friend here strangled him in a bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.68,0:11:00.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要报仇  我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want blood, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.50,0:11:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就冲我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it from me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.60,0:11:09.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.07,0:11:15.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这男的杀了我们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man killed our friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:19.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你却说他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say he's good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.70,0:11:23.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见没  这就是一个谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, now that right there is a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.59,0:11:26.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.69,0:11:29.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-拜托  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.58,0:11:34.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,教训他  伙计们  好好教训他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teach him, fellas. Teach him all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.19,0:11:38.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不要  -过来  小正太\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Come here, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.52,0:11:41.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你放开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave him be!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.56,0:11:48.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下就轮到你了  好好等着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get yours. You just wait your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.52,0:11:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  是我干的  只有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, it was me. It was just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.30,0:11:54.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧  这就对了  这才他妈不是谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, now that's right. That's not some damn lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.43,0:11:57.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能解决这个的  我们是通情达理的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we can settle this. We're reasonable men.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.71,0:12:01.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先  我们要把达里尔打死\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, we're gonna beat Daryl to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.56,0:12:04.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们再处理那个女的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll have the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.68,0:12:05.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后处理那个男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.92,0:12:09.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后我把你杀了  这样我们就扯平了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'm gonna shoot you and then we'll be square.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.04,0:12:19.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.87,0:12:21.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别扭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop your squirming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.47,0:12:29.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.90,0:12:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我制住他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.13,0:12:52.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在情况要严重得多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's gonna be so much worse now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.47,0:13:09.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.32,0:13:18.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  让我看看你有啥本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's see what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.80,0:13:27.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-放开他  不然我就...  -过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get away from him before I-- - Huh? Right over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.46,0:13:29.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看你能怎样  蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you gonna do now, sport?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.71,0:13:53.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会杀了他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.92,0:13:55.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会...我会杀了他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll-- I'll kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.25,0:13:56.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开那男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the boy go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.54,0:14:04.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.11,0:14:10.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别过来  别...求你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back. Stay-- please--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.08,0:14:46.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.14,0:14:51.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.83,0:14:54.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些林子里的野猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those feral pigs in the forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.10,0:14:57.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很容易驯养\N{\fnArial\fs30}it doesn't take much to domesticate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.78,0:14:59.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就和我们见过的那些马一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same with the horses we've seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.92,0:15:03.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有种子  我们能自己种粮食\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have seeds. We can grow our own food.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.61,0:15:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是时候开始种地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time we started planting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.55,0:15:07.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.74,0:15:11.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己可搞不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:15.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得到那边去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to go out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.82,0:15:18.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去外面找补给  去围栏那儿帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on runs, be at the fences.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.72,0:15:21.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我教你怎么务农\N{\fnArial\fs30}I teach you how to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.10,0:15:23.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你去教卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You teach Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.27,0:15:26.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会在这里待上一阵子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to be here a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.51,0:15:28.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.36,0:15:31.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经到这里两个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been here two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.22,0:15:32.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把这里运营了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've made it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.94,0:15:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战争已经结束了  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}The war is over, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.98,0:15:36.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  这我们可不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.43,0:15:39.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是在说你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.09,0:15:41.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.68,0:15:43.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要说清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm saying this,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.42,0:15:46.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不让卡尔出去  这很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}you pull Carl back from going out there, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.20,0:15:49.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他射杀了那个男孩  -是的  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He shot that boy. - Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.13,0:15:51.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他需要他的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs his father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.55,0:15:55.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他需要他的父亲给他指明道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs his father to show him the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.71,0:15:57.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要给他指明什么样的道路呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What way are you going to show him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.72,0:15:59.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会用枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can shoot,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.99,0:16:01.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}we know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.01,0:16:03.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他今后的人生怎么过\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's his life going to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.48,0:16:05.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又怎么过\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.87,0:16:10.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.93,0:16:15.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之所以对你说这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying everything
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.35,0:16:19.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为我亏欠你\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.23,0:16:22.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们大家都亏欠你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.09,0:16:28.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以把这里变好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make this better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.14,0:16:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里变好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things changing in here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:33.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面又不会变好\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't change things out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.98,0:16:35.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.34,0:16:38.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但此时此刻  我们身处这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're here today, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.15,0:16:41.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是重新开始的好机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a good place to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.69,0:16:47.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上要外出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a run soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.86,0:16:48.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.93,0:16:50.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你不必\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.35,0:17:54.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,省点水留着喝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should save it to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.77,0:17:57.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看不到自己  他可以看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't see yourself, he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.86,0:18:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道他们是什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know what they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.37,0:18:15.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会跟他们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you wind up with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.11,0:18:17.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和贝丝在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was with Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.51,0:18:20.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们逃了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got out together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.47,0:18:25.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起待了一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was with her for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.79,0:18:31.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.41,0:18:36.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她只是不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.01,0:18:43.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.09,0:18:45.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就找到了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's when they found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.12,0:18:48.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道他们很坏  但\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I knew they were bad,but ...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.62,0:18:50.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有一套准则\N{\fnArial\fs30}they had a code.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.48,0:18:53.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.06,0:18:56.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.71,0:18:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但挺有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it was something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.48,0:19:00.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.96,0:19:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且你孤身一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you were alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.89,0:19:06.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说他们在找一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said they were looking for some guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.75,0:19:11.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚  他们说找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night they said they spotted him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.82,0:19:15.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正在犹豫  我本打算离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hanging back. I was gonna leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.78,0:19:18.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但还是留下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I stayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.72,0:19:23.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在那时  我看到了你们仨\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when I saw it was you three.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.60,0:19:27.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也看到了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right when you saw me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.13,0:19:33.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.59,0:19:35.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}what they could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.68,0:19:42.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不怪你  达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not on you, Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.50,0:19:49.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.24,0:19:53.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此时此刻  你跟我们重聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You being back with us here, now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.51,0:19:55.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这才是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.38,0:20:05.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.68,0:20:22.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你昨晚的举动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what you did last night...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.60,0:20:26.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换做任何人都会那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}anybody would have done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.62,0:20:29.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  未必\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.46,0:20:37.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.22,0:20:41.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那完全不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ain't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.49,0:20:44.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔  你看到我对泰尔西做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, you saw what I did to Tyreese.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.18,0:20:47.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽不尽然  但那就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't all of it, but that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.66,0:20:51.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我和卡尔依然活着的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm here now. That's why Carl is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.86,0:20:54.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想保证他安然无恙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to keep him safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.29,0:20:58.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只在乎这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.84,0:21:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.99,0:21:18.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.71,0:21:25.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.85,0:21:27.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.80,0:21:32.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.77,0:21:37.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我也很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I'm okay, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.55,0:21:49.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(终点站)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.51,0:21:52.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们离得很近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting close.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.25,0:21:54.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日落前能到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be there before sundown.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.45,0:21:57.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在朝树林里走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we head through the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.84,0:21:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没搞清楚他们的底细\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.06,0:22:01.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.84,0:22:32.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(终点站)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.61,0:22:34.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家分散开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all spread out,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.81,0:22:37.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,踩下点  打探一下情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}watch for a while, see what we see,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.57,0:22:38.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.52,0:22:42.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别走得太远\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.09,0:22:45.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想跟我一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to stick with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.34,0:22:47.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不必了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.19,0:22:58.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不跟你老爸一块儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you go with your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.58,0:23:10.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我跟你说起安德烈时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I told you about Andre,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.14,0:23:13.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都没问过他是怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you never asked how he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.57,0:23:16.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew why.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.38,0:23:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but ...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.19,0:23:19.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过程也很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}the how is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.34,0:23:23.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们当时去了难民营\N{\fnArial\fs30}We went to a refugee camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.30,0:23:28.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有安德烈和我的男友麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andre and my boyfriend Mike,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.03,0:23:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是安德烈的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was Andre's father,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.01,0:23:31.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有我们的朋友泰瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}and our friend Terry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.97,0:23:33.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在难民营\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the camp,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.58,0:23:36.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况越来越糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}it just got worse and worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.40,0:23:38.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们都陆续离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}People were leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.28,0:23:40.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不再抱希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}People giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.49,0:23:43.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.20,0:23:47.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那天我外出归来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was coming back from a run.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.96,0:23:52.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见围墙已经倒塌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the fences were down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.34,0:23:57.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还听见了嚎叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard the moans.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.54,0:24:00.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was over.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.32,0:24:02.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦克和泰瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Mike and Terry,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.76,0:24:05.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事发时他们喝高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were high when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.77,0:24:09.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们被咬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.40,0:24:13.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本可以了结这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could have stopped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.14,0:24:16.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本可以给他们个了断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could have killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.84,0:24:21.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我却任由他们尸变\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I let them turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.46,0:24:25.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我确保他们没法咬人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made it so they couldn't bite,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.27,0:24:26.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没法抓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}couldn't scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.32,0:24:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给他们套上锁链\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tied chains around their necks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.30,0:24:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.59,0:24:33.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.25,0:24:37.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我是罪有应得\N{\fnArial\fs30}It felt like what I deserved,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.67,0:24:41.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,牵着他们到处走  让他们提醒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}dragging them around so that I would always know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.49,0:24:44.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果我发现他们还能保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found out that they kept me safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.37,0:24:50.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,掩护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hid me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.97,0:24:53.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸们无法辨认出我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The walkers didn't see me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.31,0:24:56.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不过是另一个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just another monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.05,0:24:59.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的确是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.63,0:25:01.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.64,0:25:05.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很久以来  我活得像个行尸走肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gone for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.82,0:25:12.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但后来安德莉亚让我振作起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then Andrea brought me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.26,0:25:14.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸让我振作起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad brought me back
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.98,0:25:18.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.18,0:25:27.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看见你瞧你爸的眼神了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see how you've been looking at your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.78,0:25:30.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没必要害怕我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to be afraid of me
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.86,0:25:32.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者你爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}or him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.62,0:25:40.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那天他跟我讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me the other day
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.11,0:25:42.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他以我为傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he was proud of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.82,0:25:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还说我是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.92,0:25:48.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.98,0:25:51.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-卡尔  -我现在更加清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carl. - I know more now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.38,0:25:54.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想要我成为怎样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what he wanted from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.88,0:25:56.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我努力过了  但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I tried, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.42,0:26:00.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是摆脱不了这些想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still have these thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.51,0:26:10.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是他认为的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not what he thinks I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.95,0:26:16.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just another monster, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.06,0:27:06.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.35,0:27:36.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终点站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terminus--
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.63,0:27:37.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(火警安全门)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.26,0:27:39.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抵达就能活命\N{\fnArial\fs30}those who arrive survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.22,0:27:41.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沿着轨道前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow the tracks to the point
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.69,0:27:44.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走到轨道交汇点\N{\fnArial\fs30}where all lines intersect.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.02,0:27:45.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十字路口处有地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are maps at the crossings
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.81,0:27:48.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为你指明道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help guide you with your journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.68,0:27:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,避难所欢迎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sanctuary for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.15,0:27:52.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,社区欢迎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Community for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.85,0:27:56.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抵达就能活命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those who arrive survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.67,0:27:59.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终点站  避难所和社区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terminus, sanctuary for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.65,0:28:01.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-欢迎所有人  -你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Community for all. - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.27,0:28:02.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抵达就...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those who s--
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.16,0:28:04.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.08,0:28:12.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是艾伯特在放哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I bet Albert is on perimeter watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.29,0:28:20.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是来抢劫的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You here to rob us?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.63,0:28:22.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.68,0:28:27.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想在你看到我们之前  先来见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wanted to see you before you saw us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.07,0:28:33.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.39,0:28:36.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一般会在轨道交汇处欢迎别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usually we do this where the tracks meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.97,0:28:40.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到终点站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Terminus.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.96,0:28:43.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫葛瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Gareth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.77,0:28:46.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你们在外面漂泊很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you've been on the road for a good bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.98,0:28:49.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.18,0:28:54.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫瑞克  那是卡尔  达里尔  米琼恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick. That's Carl, Daryl, Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.35,0:29:00.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们很紧张  我能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're nervous. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.54,0:29:01.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也是一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were all the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.54,0:29:05.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是来这里避难的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came here for sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.75,0:29:08.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们也是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That what you're here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.80,0:29:10.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.25,0:29:11.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.78,0:29:14.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们找对地方了  亚历克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found it. Hey, Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.86,0:29:17.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里不如前门好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't as pretty as the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.01,0:29:17.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们倒是没什么可隐藏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got nothing to hide,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.64,0:29:20.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是迎宾处比这儿看起来好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the welcome wagon is a whole lot nicer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.63,0:29:23.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚历克斯会带你们过去  问几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex will take you, ask you a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.60,0:29:25.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, but first,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.63,0:29:28.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要检查一下你们的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need to see everyone's weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.41,0:29:31.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请把武器放到你们前面的地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you could just lay them down in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.21,0:29:44.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.77,0:29:47.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-相信你能够理解  -是的  我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sure you understand. - Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.58,0:29:58.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想见到打你的那人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd hate to see the other guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.71,0:30:00.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.43,0:30:06.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他们罪有应得吗  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They deserve it? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.83,0:30:12.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只想让你们知道  我们不是恶人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so you know, we aren't those kind of people,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.15,0:30:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们也不傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we aren't stupid either.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.30,0:30:16.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们也不该做傻事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you shouldn't be stupid enough to try anything stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.16,0:30:19.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有这点共识\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as everyone's clear on that,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.26,0:30:20.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就没什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}we shouldn't have any problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.42,0:30:22.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有的只是解决办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just solutions.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.67,0:30:25.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.23,0:30:46.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.58,0:30:56.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个地方有多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how long's this place been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.58,0:30:58.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多从一开始就有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since almost the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.20,0:31:00.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他营地被行尸蹂躏后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When all the camps got overrun,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.83,0:31:02.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们开始向这里汇集\N{\fnArial\fs30}people started finding this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.11,0:31:04.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这是人的本能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it was instinct, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.55,0:31:06.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,循着一条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow a path.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.68,0:31:09.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有的人往海岸走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some folks were heading to the coast,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.13,0:31:10.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有的人往西边或北边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}others out west or up north,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.61,0:31:12.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们最后都会来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they all wound up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.46,0:31:18.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说你们是从后门进来的  真聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heard you came in the back door. Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.54,0:31:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们很适合这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll fit right in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.26,0:31:26.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽  给这些新人点吃的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mary, would you fix each of these new folks a plate for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.46,0:31:28.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.71,0:31:31.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们为什么欢迎外人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you let people in?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.31,0:31:33.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,越多人加入  我们越强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more people become a part of us, we get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.40,0:31:37.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们才会设置标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we put up the signs,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.61,0:31:38.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邀请人们加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}invite people in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.80,0:31:41.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们的生存之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's how we survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.71,0:31:43.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.09,0:31:56.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.28,0:32:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这表你是从哪搞来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell did you get this watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.23,0:32:34.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-帕特里克  -格兰姆斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Patrick. - Hey, Mr. Grimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.86,0:32:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢你拿回来了这些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for grabbing these.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.40,0:32:39.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为卡尔会想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I thought Carl might want 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.66,0:32:41.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们放在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were just sitting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.04,0:32:45.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半天也没人玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured it had been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.45,0:32:50.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然这是4到12岁儿童玩的  但我不觉得羞愧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not ashamed that they're for ages four to 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.57,0:32:52.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不该感到羞愧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.55,0:33:22.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-卡尔  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carl. - Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.65,0:33:25.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.05,0:33:29.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你帮我个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.83,0:33:34.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.55,0:33:36.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.21,0:33:43.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪只会碍事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll just get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.20,0:33:47.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这表他妈的是从哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell did you get this watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.63,0:33:50.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要答案吗  你想要别的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want answers? You want anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.11,0:33:51.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下枪你才能得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get 'em when you put down the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.99,0:33:54.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到你们楼顶上的狙击手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see your man on the roof with a sniper rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.14,0:33:57.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他枪法有多好  这表到底是哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How good's his aim? Where'd you get the watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.36,0:34:04.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-表是哪来的  -别轻举妄动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where'd you get the watch?! - Don't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.25,0:34:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切在我掌控中  放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have this! You just put it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.26,0:34:08.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.97,0:34:11.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好听我的话  我们的人很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to listen to me. There's a lot of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.67,0:34:14.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这表是从哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get the watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.64,0:34:16.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从死人身上扒下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it off of a dead one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.16,0:34:17.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他用不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think he'd need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.53,0:34:21.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那身防爆服呢  那个斗篷呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the riot gear? The poncho?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.75,0:34:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,防爆服是一个死警察的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got the riot gear off a dead cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.19,0:34:27.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斗篷是在晒衣绳上取的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found the poncho on a clothesline.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.94,0:34:31.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-葛瑞  我们可以等等  -闭嘴  亚历克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gareth, we can wait. - Shut up, Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.06,0:34:32.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有话就对我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.68,0:34:36.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有什么好说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's there left to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.35,0:34:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不再信任我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't trust us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.10,0:34:40.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-葛瑞  -闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gareth. - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.95,0:34:43.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-葛瑞  求你了  -没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gareth, please. - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.54,0:34:44.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.82,0:34:47.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.63,0:34:50.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的人在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are our people?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.09,0:34:51.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有回答问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.59,0:34:57.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.78,0:35:00.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伏身  快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down, now! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.46,0:35:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝主干道射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shots fired in the main.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.20,0:35:02.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往大楼方向赶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heading into the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.10,0:35:05.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.68,0:35:12.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.03,0:35:22.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.91,0:35:33.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay on your shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.08,0:35:42.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快  这边  -把他们从B口赶走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, this way. - Get them off B!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.87,0:35:57.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-救命  -怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help! Help! - What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.38,0:35:58.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.35,0:36:00.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-救命  -继续跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help! - Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.87,0:36:01.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.77,0:36:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这他妈是什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.57,0:36:14.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这些人不是想杀掉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people, I don't think they're trying to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.20,0:36:14.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.16,0:36:17.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.69,0:36:17.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  他们瞄准的是我们的脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they were aiming at our feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.25,0:36:18.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(我们永远在第一位)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.18,0:36:20.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.61,0:36:26.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.36,0:36:28.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.25,0:37:11.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your weapons! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.69,0:37:24.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.02,0:37:34.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头领  往左走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ringleader, go to your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.89,0:37:36.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,火车厢那边  快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The train car, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.42,0:37:41.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你照我们说的做  这男孩就跟你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do what we say, the boy goes with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.59,0:37:45.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然他就要死  你也要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else, he dies and you end up in there anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.59,0:37:59.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着是弩手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the archer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.43,0:38:11.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着是武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.22,0:38:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(奶粉)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.11,0:38:38.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站在门口  按照头领\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand at the door, ringleader,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.58,0:38:41.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弓箭手和武士这个顺序\N{\fnArial\fs30}archer, samurai, in that order.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.04,0:38:48.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.05,0:38:53.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.18,0:39:04.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头领  打开门走进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ringleader, open the door and go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.23,0:39:05.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要和他一起进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go in with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.73,0:39:07.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别逼我们现在就杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make us kill him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.96,0:40:04.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.25,0:40:10.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.64,0:40:17.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.88,0:40:33.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是我们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.13,0:40:38.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们救了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They helped save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.14,0:40:40.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.40,0:40:44.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他们就是我们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they're friends of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.70,0:40:47.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜时日不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For however long that'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.51,0:40:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.24,0:41:02.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真乖  朱迪思\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go, Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.03,0:41:04.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.30,0:41:10.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,插进去的时候角度大一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it in at more of an angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.20,0:41:19.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该给你弄一顶农夫帽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna have to get you a farming hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.78,0:41:23.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城里来了个新警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a new sheriff in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.77,0:41:27.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-看上去如何  -很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's it look? - Looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.38,0:41:34.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以一直都这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can be like this all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.05,0:41:38.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.75,0:41:42.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.55,0:41:54.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等他们发现时  就会觉得自己很蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna feel pretty stupid when they find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.23,0:41:59.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发现什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find out what?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.38,0:42:17.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们惹了不该惹的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're screwing with the wrong people.
